@startuml
actor User
participant "客户端" as Client
participant "Flask" as Server
participant "爬虫类" as Spider
activate User
activate Client
User -> Client: 提交爬虫任务请求
Client -> Server: 启动爬虫
activate Server
Server -> Spider: 调用start函数
activate Spider
Spider -> Spider: 初始化爬虫参数
Spider -> Spider: 构建WebDriver
Spider -> Spider: 执行滑块验证
Spider -> Spider: 获取HTML源码
Spider -> Spider: 解析HTML并提取数据
Spider -> Spider: 将数据存储到指定存储引擎中
Spider -> Spider: 关闭WebDriver
deactivate Spider
Server -> Client: 返回爬虫任务完成消息
deactivate Server
deactivate Client
deactivate User
@enduml
